From fb395890cb0675e9c817f23647c858ba824c5667 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: blame42 <346530647+git-blame-42@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 16:10:29 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Add comments to events

New comments table (child of events, ON DELETE CASCADE) and Comment model with BelongsTo event and user, validated with notEmpty and the new Validations::maxLength (500). Logged users comment through POST /events/{id}/comments; participants get a minimal GET /events/{id} page and admins see the same list and form in the admin show. Populate seeds a few comments.
